  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The guru’s skill in controlling essence is now so potent that he can even damage physical objects with a touch. While using his gentle touch ability, the guru can attempt a sunder combat maneuver to sunder an item held or worn by his opponent. If the attack is successful, he deals damage to the item as normal for his gentle touch attack. This attack ignores ½ of the target’s Hardness. In addition, his gentle touch ability can now be used to damage constructs and deals lethal damage to such creatures.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/guru#toc11\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
